# Deprecated standalone Makefile patch

This file is retained only as historical review context. Do not apply it as a
standalone patch.

The complete initial series is now split into dependency-ordered patches:

1. `0001-dt-bindings-arm-qcom-add-xiaomi-platina.patch`
2. `0002-arm64-dts-qcom-add-xiaomi-platina.patch`
3. `0003-arm64-dts-qcom-add-platina-dtb-target.patch`

The DTS source is added in patch 2 before patch 3 registers its DTB target.
The binding patch adds `xiaomi,platina` to the existing SDM660 compatible
list. The series has been stored in the repository, but has not yet been
applied to or built against a complete Linux v7.3.1 checkout.
